<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Lima starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cementos Lima starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment said it had started Peru's Cementos Lima S.A. with a rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Jose Corral and Corina Lopez wrote in an analysis, &quot;Our 12- to 18-month price target is $19.20 for the common shares, translating into 19.6 percent upside plus a 1997 estimated 6.6 percent dividend yield.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
